      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْهَرٌ</span></b>  The <i>place of a river.</i> (T, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A
place which the water hollows out in a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهْر</span> [or
<i>channel of a river</i>]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>A cleft,</i> (K, TA,)
or <i>hole,</i> (TA,) <i>in a fortress, passing through</i> [<i>the
wall</i>], <i>whence water runs.</i> (K, TA,) or <i>by which
